    "detailed_description": "Bulletz is a chaotic 8 player shared screen twin stick shooter. You play a series of rounds in destructible levels trying to kill your opponents with guns that randomly spawn. The first player to 10 kills wins the match! The game has a self balancing handicap for those not as skilled. There are over 50 guns, powerups and items that can spawn in over 60 levels!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControllers required for local pvp/coop play.",
